This report describes the sample: the participants’ ages and chronotypes, the number of diary days that each person completed, and the spread of nightly sleep and daily mood.
site &lt;- Sys.getenv("QUARTO_PROJECT_DIR")
if (!nzchar(site)) {
  site &lt;- Find(function(dir) file.exists(file.path(dir, "_quarto.yml")), c(".", ".."))
}
if (is.null(site)) {
  stop("Run this code from the site folder or from its analyses/ folder.")
}
source(file.path(site, "_scripts", "report.R"), local = TRUE)

This report fits the main models of the paper, which ask two questions. The within-person effect is the change in a person’s mood on days after they sleep more than usual. The between-person effect is the difference in mood between people who sleep more overall and people who sleep less.
